msgstr "网卡"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Count one adapter, or every physical one."
msgstr "只统计一个网卡，或统计所有物理网卡。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Network rates"
msgstr "网络速率"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Disk speeds stay in bytes."
msgstr "磁盘速率仍以字节显示。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Show the upload rate above the download rate."
msgstr "将上传速率显示在下载速率上方。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "An IPv4 address or a name."
msgstr "IPv4 地址或主机名。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "间隔"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Milliseconds between pings."
msgstr "两次 Ping 之间的间隔（毫秒）。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "For Pulsar's windows, menus and labels."
msgstr "用于 Pulsar 的窗口、菜单和标签。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Start with Windows"
msgstr "开机自启"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Launch Pulsar when you sign in."
msgstr "登录 Windows 时自动启动 Pulsar。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Look for a new release once a day. Nothing is downloaded automatically."
msgstr "每天检查一次新版本，不会自动下载任何内容。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Tray icon"
msgstr "托盘图标"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Show Pulsar in the notification area. When hidden, right-click the overlay for the menu, or start Pulsar again to open Settings."
msgstr "在通知区域显示 Pulsar 图标。隐藏后，可右键单击任务栏上的监控条打开菜单，或再次启动 Pulsar 打开设置。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "快捷键"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Select a box and press the keys, with Ctrl, Alt or Win. Backspace clears it. They work anywhere in Windows."
msgstr "选中一个框并按下按键，需包含 Ctrl、Alt 或 Win。按 Backspace 清除。它们在 Windows 中随处可用。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Show or hide Pulsar"
msgstr "显示或隐藏 Pulsar"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Turn the desktop widget on or off"
msgstr "打开或关闭桌面小组件"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Open system details"
msgstr "打开系统详细信息"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Start or stop recording to CSV"
msgstr "开始或停止记录到 CSV"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "警报"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "CPU temperature (°F)"
msgstr "CPU 温度（°F）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "CPU temperature (°C)"
msgstr "CPU 温度（°C）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "When it stays at or above this for half a minute. Needs the sensor service."
msgstr "达到或超过此值并持续半分钟时。需要传感器服务。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "GPU temperature (°F)"
msgstr "GPU 温度（°F）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "GPU temperature (°C)"
msgstr "GPU 温度（°C）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "When it stays at or above this for half a minute."
msgstr "达到或超过此值并持续半分钟时。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Battery charge (%)"
msgstr "电池电量（%）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "When it falls to this on battery power."
msgstr "使用电池供电且降至此值时。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Drive free space (%)"
msgstr "驱动器可用空间（%）"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "When any drive falls to this."
msgstr "任一驱动器降至此值时。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Sampling"
msgstr "采样"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Milliseconds between readings."
msgstr "两次读数之间的间隔（毫秒）。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "History length"
msgstr "历史长度"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Readings kept for the graphs."
msgstr "图表保留的读数个数。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Reset all settings"
msgstr "重置所有设置"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Everything except Start with Windows and the language goes back to its default."
msgstr "除“开机自启”和语言外，所有设置都将恢复默认值。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Start over with the default look and items."
msgstr "恢复默认的外观和监控项。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Reset…"
msgstr "重置…"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "A profile keeps what the overlay and widget show and how they look: items, layout, theme, popups, widget, units, drives and network. Language, startup, update interval, games, alerts and shortcuts stay the same in every profile. Switch profiles here or from the Profiles menu."
msgstr "配置文件保存叠加层和小组件显示的内容及其外观：项目、布局、主题、弹出窗口、小组件、单位、驱动器和网络。语言、启动、更新间隔、游戏、警报和快捷键在所有配置文件中保持不变。可在此处或“配置文件”菜单中切换。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Save as a profile"
msgstr "另存为配置文件"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Keeps the current settings under a name. Saving with a profile's name again updates it."
msgstr "以一个名称保存当前设置。使用已有配置文件的名称再次保存会更新它。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Profiles folder"
msgstr "配置文件文件夹"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Profile files to back up or share."
msgstr "用于备份或分享的配置文件。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Saved profiles"
msgstr "已保存的配置文件"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Current"
msgstr "当前"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Pulsar {}"
msgstr "Pulsar {}"

#: ui/settings.slint
