#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Save every reading Pulsar can take to a text file in the logs folder, to attach to an issue. It lists process and network adapter names; read it before sharing."
msgstr "将 Pulsar 能读取的全部数据保存为日志文件夹中的文本文件，以便附加到 issue。其中包含进程和网络适配器名称；分享前请先查看。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Save report"
msgstr "保存报告"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Source code"
msgstr "源代码"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Open on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上打开"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "报告问题"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Attach pulsar.log, and any crash report, from the logs folder."
msgstr "请附上日志文件夹中的 pulsar.log 以及崩溃报告（如有）。"

#: ui/settings.slint
msgid "Report an issue"
msgstr "提交问题"
